{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve accepted snapshots when rejecting an oversized record.** With FIFO semantics, the incoming record no longer supersedes earlier snapshots, but this call deletes every queued record for the same execution (up to 16). A large terminal output can therefore erase all valid RUNNING progress even though those records fit the budget. Drop only the oversized incoming record, leave the existing FIFO intact, and update the over-budget regression to assert those records are still exported.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7s7c6r","finding_digest":"6580a7b73e4577494e71c950f83ebc453d9a05ac0e374aecfc691e0752d69ba1","finding_id":"arf_v1_mwakpnz6iv3usttrzfipqpv4iu","finding_key":"insight/export-scheduler::_exporterlane.schedule::oversized-record-preserves-existing-fifo","identity_key":"insight/export-scheduler::_exporterlane.schedule::oversized-record-preserves-existing-fifo","line":329,"observation_digest":"0c74178585158cfe6d3094fc1aa3df3e6171c39689cab85f807e47d711a48a46","observation_id":"aro_v1_br2bpbmfcwgp43jqst6bvi67hz","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_insight/_export_scheduler.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-10T02:48:44Z","review_id":"arr_v1_aeoofhgidkz2f3pbrmhndt6v5s","reviewed_base_sha":"4bd5e14f415ee5f249d3e4ff6501b023bcf916f7","reviewed_head_sha":"f91e2eb90cd3f98c7162cea732d115be9d9cd2fc","reviewer":"codex","start_line":329,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":713},"record_id":"art_v1_25ofj7l5zfksso766ecczivn2d","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-10T02:48:44Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
